{"path":"container/inplace_vector/swap","title":"std::inplace_vector<T,N>::swap","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::inplace_vector&lt;T,N&gt;::</span>swap","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector/swap","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Exchanges the contents of the container with those of other. Does not cause iterators and references to associate with the other container.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx26\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> swap<span class=\"br0\">(</span> inplace_vector<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"coMULTI\">/* see below */</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(since C++26)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Exchanges the contents of the container with those of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code>. Does not cause iterators and references to associate with the other container.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> container to exchange the contents with\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<div class=\"t-noexcept-full\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/language/noexcept_spec\"><code>noexcept</code></a> specification:&nbsp;&nbsp;\n<div class=\"t-noexcept-box\"><span class=\"t-cc\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>N <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span> <span class=\"sy3\">||</span><br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_swappable\"><span class=\"kw580\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_nothrow_swappable_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_move_constructible\"><span class=\"kw550\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_nothrow_move_constructible_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></span></div></div>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Linear in size of the container.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;inplace_vector&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;print&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector\"><span class=\"kw3363\">std::<span class=\"me2\">inplace_vector</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> a1<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>, a2<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">4</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">5</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">6</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> i1 <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> a1.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> i2 <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> a2.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> r1 <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> a1<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> r2 <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> a2<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> print_them_all <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> rem<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/println\"><span class=\"kw3402\">std::<span class=\"me2\">println</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"{}a1 = {}, a2 = {}, *i1 = {}, *i2 = {}, r1 = {}, r2 = {}\"</span>,\n                     rem, a1, a2, <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>i1, <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>i2, r1, r2<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    print_them_all<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"Before swap:<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    a1.<span class=\"me1\">swap</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>a2<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    print_them_all<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"After swap:<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"co1\">// Note that after swap() iterators and references stay associated with their</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// original sites, e.g., i1 points to element a1[0], r1 refers to a1[1].</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Before swap:\na1 = [1, 2, 3], a2 = [4, 5, 6], *i1 = 1, *i2 = 4, r1 = 2, r2 = 5\nAfter swap:\na1 = [4, 5, 6], a2 = [1, 2, 3], *i1 = 4, *i2 = 1, r1 = 5, r2 = 2</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector/swap2\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>std::swap<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(std::inplace_vector)</span></span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(C++26)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  specializes the <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/swap\">std::swap</a></span> algorithm <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/inplace_vector","title":"std::inplace_vector"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::inplace_vector<T,N>::swap","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++26. Exchanges the contents of the container with those of other."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"other"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Exceptions"},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Linear in size of the container."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"std::swap(std::inplace_vector)","note":"specializes the std::swap algorithm"}]}]},"standards":["C++26"],"wordCount":216,"codeBlockCount":2}
